00:10:37.489 --> 00:10:40.069
(audience cheers)

00:10:40.069 --> 00:10:41.429
- We're so happy.

00:10:41.429 --> 00:10:43.263
- I cannot tell you how
meaningful that was to me.

00:10:43.263 --> 00:10:45.154
- I was nervous though 'cause
both dishes looked exactly

00:10:45.154 --> 00:10:48.449
identical to me but I forgot about taste.

00:10:48.449 --> 00:10:49.448
That's a big thing.

00:10:49.448 --> 00:10:50.641
- Oh yeah and it turned out to be.

00:10:50.641 --> 00:10:53.501
- So excited to go to a
restaurant with awesome food

00:10:53.501 --> 00:10:55.293
without children in it.

00:10:55.293 --> 00:10:57.168
- Oh my goodness yes, we will
see you at Tasty All-Stars.

00:10:57.168 --> 00:10:58.428
- Yeah.

00:10:58.428 --> 00:11:00.843
- We're pretty devastated.

00:11:00.843 --> 00:11:02.607
- You do like to win but then again,

00:11:02.607 --> 00:11:05.276
it's really about the process
and having fun and we had fun.

00:11:05.276 --> 00:11:06.804
- It was really fun to cook together.

00:11:06.804 --> 00:11:08.548
- And we did learn another
recipe and definitely can

00:11:08.548 --> 00:11:09.989
try it again at home.

00:11:09.989 --> 00:11:10.988
- Thank you to Smorgasburg for hosting us,

00:11:10.988 --> 00:11:13.391
thank you to my amazing audience.

00:11:13.391 --> 00:11:17.558
This has been Tasty Date Night
brought to you by Toyota.

